    <name>Sweet Spot (42min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 8min ramp from 50% to 75% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 90% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 60% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 90% FTP | Cooldown: 3min from 60% to 45% FTP</description>
